  "title": {
    "zh": "网闸 · NetGate",
    "en": "NetGate"
  },
  "description": {
    "zh": "DeepSeek Harness 的联网总开关（手机端 dsh-go / 电脑端 DSH Desktop）。关闭后工具与命令层被拦；本地编辑通常照常，编译、装包等需要联网的步骤可能失败。",
    "en": "An internet switch for DeepSeek Harness (phone dsh-go / desktop DSH Desktop). Local editing usually keeps working; builds and installs that need the network may fail."
  },
