    {
      "name": "dsh-netgate-win",
      "title": {
        "zh": "网闸 · Windows 版",
        "en": "NetGate for Windows"
      },
      "description": {
        "zh": "电脑端（Windows DSH Desktop）：移除联网搜索与网页抓取、拒绝联网命令；没有进程级断网，严格模式重启后自动关闭。手机端是另一个包 dsh-netgate 0.3.0。",
        "en": "Windows (DSH Desktop): removes web search/fetch and refuses networked commands; no process-level blocking, and strict mode resets on restart. The phone build is a separate package (dsh-netgate 0.3.0)."
